WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.500
Run 33 gave this refusal its own sentence.

2
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.000
The gate had already resolved them.

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.900
The choices needed a column of their own.

4
00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:16.300
A chip sends a domain, not a name.

5
00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:19.600
Five arguments became one value.

6
00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:23.600
A mutation found the seam that dropped it.

7
00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:27.300
The sentence changes with the buttons.

8
00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:30.400
And this question has no skip.

9
00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:33.400
The question, handed back as buttons.
